      "id": 1,
      "text": "Collingwood was originally inhabited by the Wurundjeri people, who called the area Yálla‑birr‑ang.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
